<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p><strong><span>Veena Celestia Borivali West Mumbai </span></strong><span>is a premium residential redevelopment project at Chandavarkar Lane, offering thoughtfully designed </span><strong><span>2, 3 BHK Flats  with deck options</span></strong><span> in a secure gated community. Developed by </span><strong><span>Veena Developers</span></strong><span>, the project combines contemporary architecture, modern lifestyle amenities and efficient urban living, with excellent connectivity to </span><strong><span>Borivali West Railway Station, Shimpoli Metro Station, S.V. Road and key lifestyle destinations</span></strong><span>, making it an attractive residential and investment opportunity in Mumbai’s western suburbs.</span></p></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
