            <h2 class="why-consider-heading" id="why-consider-heading">Why you should consider Veena Celestia?</h2>
            
              <div class="why-consider-list" id="why-consider-list">
              <ul><li>Modern residences where thoughtful planning meets elegant design and effortless everyday functionality.</li><li>Infiniti Mall and Raghuleela Mall keep shopping, dining, and entertainment conveniently close.</li><li>Rustomjee International School and R.R. International College provide diverse learning choices close to home.</li><li>Reach Mindspace Malad and NESCO effortlessly through Borivali’s strategic connectivity.</li><li>Easy access to Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport makes frequent travel more convenient.</li><li>S.V. Road just minutes away, making everyday Mumbai travel smoother and faster.</li></ul>
