 <section class="white-box about-project" id="about-project" aria-labelledby="about-project-heading">
          <span class="section-label">Overview</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="about-project-heading">About Veena Celestia, Borivali West by Veena Developers</h2>
          
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Veena Celestia offers a compelling residential experience for a diverse range of homebuyers.</p><p><strong>Young Professionals and First-Time Buyers</strong> will find Veena Celestia an attractive proposition, with configurations like Retail Shop and 2 BHK Apartment offering efficient living spaces starting from 277 Sq.Ft., complemented by the project's excellent 4.1. The competitive pricing, with options starting from ₹ 2.70 Cr, makes it an ideal entry point into the property market, while its proximity to Swami Vivekanand Road, Lokmanya Tilak Road ensures easy commutes.</p><p><strong>Growing Families</strong> seeking more space will appreciate the availability of larger configurations and the community-focused environment. The project's location within the well-regarded Borivali West, boasting a strong education &amp; healthcare index of 4.4, provides a nurturing setting for families, with Gokhale Education Society, MK High School, La Stella International Montessori, Gokhale Education Society Shishu Vikas Mandir, Gopal Garden High School also being a significant advantage. The development’s overall living spaces are designed to foster comfort and togetherness.</p><p><strong>Property Investors</strong> can look to Veena Celestia as a promising asset, given its location in the dynamic Mumbai Western Suburbs and the area's strong rental yield potential, reflected in the ₹ 76 /Sq.Ft.. The project's comprehensive amenities and the developer's track record of 55 add further confidence to its investment appeal. The range of unit types, from Retail Shop to Retail Shop, ensures diverse investment opportunities.</p><br><p><strong>Veena Celestia </span></strong> is an upcoming premium residential redevelopment project located at </span><strong>Chandavarkar Lane, Borivali West Mumbai </span></strong>, near the iconic Raj Mahal Hotel. Developed as the redevelopment of </span><strong>Krishna Nagar Society</span></strong>, the project is positioned as a refined urban address that brings together modern design, everyday convenience and an elevated lifestyle in one of Mumbai’s established residential neighbourhoods.</span></p><p>The project offers </span><strong>2, 3 BHK Flats</span></strong>, designed for contemporary families seeking spacious and functional homes.</span> The project is described as a premium high-rise residential community with a low-density positioning and a secure gated environment.</span></p><p>The residences at Veena Celestia project_name  are planned with an emphasis on </span><strong>space efficiency, functionality, comfort and modern urban living</span></strong> Thoughtfully designed layouts, deck spaces and contemporary planning are intended to create homes that feel spacious while supporting natural light, ventilation and comfortable day-to-day movement. The project combines practical residential planning with the convenience expected from a premium redevelopment.</span></p><p>Veena Celestia brings together </span><strong>modern architecture and lifestyle-oriented amenities</span></strong> to create a complete residential experience. Residents can access facilities such as a </span><strong>gym, clubhouse, mini theatre and temple</span></strong>, along with other planned lifestyle spaces. The development is designed to provide a balance between private living, recreation, wellness and community interaction within a secure residential environment.</span></p><p><strong>Veena Developers </span></strong>, the developer behind Veena Celestia, has been active in the real estate sector since </span><strong>1990</span></strong>, with experience across residential, corporate and industrial spaces. The developer highlights quality construction, modernisation, customer convenience and a customer-centric approach, with </span><strong>more than 34 years of experience</span></strong> in the real estate industry. Its stated values include integrity, honesty and trust, with an emphasis on establishing long-term relationships with customers.</span></p><div><div><p>The possession date as per the RERA guidelines for PM1180002600530 - December 2030</p></div></div></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

      </section>



      
