  <div class="desc-text"><p>Veena Celestia offers a diverse range of residential units, meticulously designed to cater to various lifestyle needs.</p><p><strong>Retail Shop</strong> provides generous living spaces spanning <strong>277 Sq. Ft.</strong>, emphasizing efficient layouts for comfortable family living.</p><p>Experience the thoughtfully crafted <strong>2 BHK Apartment</strong>, boasting <strong>548 Sq. Ft.</strong> and available from <strong>₹ 2.70 Cr</strong>, perfect for modern urban dwellers.</p><p>The <strong>2 BHK Apartment</strong> configuration offers <strong>775 Sq. Ft.</strong>, ideal for those seeking well-proportioned and functional homes.</p><p>Discover ample room within the <strong>3 BHK Apartment</strong>, providing <strong>909 Sq. Ft.</strong> of dedicated living space.</p><p>The <strong>3 BHK Apartment</strong> configuration is designed with <strong>1064 Sq. Ft.</strong>, ensuring a balance of comfort and utility.</p><p>Finally, the <strong>Retail Shop</strong> presents <strong>1122 Sq. Ft.</strong>, offering a spacious and inviting home environment.</p><br><p>The pricing for Veena Celestia offers a comprehensive range, starting from <strong>₹ 2.70 Cr</strong> and extending up to <strong>₹ 5.25 Cr</strong> For specific configurations, you can explore <strong>2 BHK: ₹ 2.70 Cr, 3 BHK: ₹ 4.48 Cr</strong>, providing a clear overview of costs for different layouts. Individual unit pricing is also available, with options and <strong>₹ 2.70 Cr</strong> to consider. These prices are benchmarked against the micromarket's average asking price of <strong>₹ 35,900 /Sq.Ft.</strong>, and also compared to the locality's average asking price of <strong>₹ 30,750 /Sq.Ft.</strong>, offering valuable context for your investment.</p></div>
