            <div id="master-plan-details-panel-1" class="master-plan-details master-plan-detail-panel active">
              <h3 class="master-plan-title">Master Plan 1</h3>
              
                
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text master-plan-info"><div class="item"><strong>Overview about Veena Celestia</strong><ul><li>Veena Celestia is a mixed-use urban development featuring residential towers integrated with commercial and retail spaces. This project offers a functional living environment with essential amenities and landscaped open areas.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Land Use and Density</strong><ul><li>Around 25%-33% of the plot is green, anchored by Landscaped Open Space, providing residents with areas for relaxation and natural views.</li><li>The open area covers 40%-58% of the plot, which includes this area, giving residents ample room to move and gather outdoors.</li><li>With a built-up percentage of 40%-48%, the project provides a balanced environment where homes receive good air and light, complemented by podium floors that contribute to the overall spatial arrangement.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Connectivity Access</strong><ul><li>The project benefits from proximity to Swami Vivekanand Road and Lokmanya Tilak Road, and features direct frontage on 27.45M WIDE CHANDAVARKAR ROAD and 13.41 MT WIDE ROAD, ensuring convenient travel for daily commutes and errands. Parking is provided through Basement/Multi-level facilities, accessible via a Ramp Up.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Amenities Lifestyle</strong><ul><li>The development includes Shops and Commercial spaces, offering residents convenient access to daily necessities and services within the premises.</li><li>A Fitness Center is available, allowing residents to maintain their health and wellness routines without leaving the property.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Tower Placement Orientation</strong><ul><li>Two distinct towers, WING-A and WING-B, are arranged in a parallel configuration.</li><li>WING-A occupies the South-Western portion of the property's built area.</li><li>WING-B is situated towards the North-Eastern side of the development.</li><li>Both residential structures are aligned predominantly along an East-West axis.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Amenity Access</strong><ul><li>Residents of WING-A have direct access to the ground floor facilities within their building.</li><li>The ground floor facilities in WING-B are easily reachable for its occupants.</li><li>The central zone between the two wings facilitates convenient access to shared services.</li><li>Individuals residing on higher levels can comfortably reach the podium amenities.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Noise Privacy Road Facing</strong><ul><li>Units facing the 27.45M WIDE CHANDAVARKAR ROAD on the South may experience external sounds.</li><li>Residences along the East boundary could be exposed to activity from the 13.41 MT WIDE ROAD.</li><li>Homes on the North side of the property might hear sounds from the 13.41 MT WIDE ROAD.</li><li>The landscaped area separating WING-A and WING-B provides a degree of quiet for internal units.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Corridor Analysis</strong><ul><li>The spacing between WING-A and WING-B allows for ample natural light into homes.</li><li>The layout promotes good air movement throughout the residential areas.</li><li>The separation of the buildings ensures residents do not feel overcrowded.</li><li>Clear lines of sight are maintained across the central open space.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Internal Circulation Pedestrian</strong><ul><li>People can walk along the edges of the buildings on the ground level.</li><li>The area between WING-A and WING-B is suitable for walking paths.</li><li>Residents can move between the two structures using the central passage.</li><li>The design enables easy foot travel from residential floors to the lower levels.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Child Senior Friendly Zones</strong><ul><li>The central green space offers a secure area for younger residents to play.</li><li>Older residents can enjoy peaceful walks along the planted borders of the property.</li><li>Ground level access to facilities makes movement simple for all age groups.</li><li>The design includes areas for quiet relaxation away from busy street activity.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Green Cover Landscape</strong><ul><li>Landscaped sections are positioned centrally between WING-A and WING-B.</li><li>Greenery extends along the entire South perimeter of the development.</li><li>Planted areas are also present along the East and North boundaries of the property.</li><li>These green elements contribute to a pleasant atmosphere around the buildings.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Traffic Flow Access Planning</strong><ul><li>Cars enter and exit the property from the main roads bordering the site.</li><li>A central ramp provides access for vehicles to the lower parking levels.</li><li>Vehicles can circulate around the structures to reach specific drop-off zones.</li><li>The plan manages car movement to minimize disturbance to residents.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Overall Livability Assessment</strong><ul><li>The project provides a practical living solution with integrated residential and this amenity.</li><li>Its location offers direct connections to the surrounding urban environment.</li><li>The design incorporates green areas for residents to enjoy daily activities.</li><li>This development presents a functional and well-connected urban address for its occupants.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Final Summary</strong><p>Living at this area offers a practical urban experience, where daily needs are met within the development itself. Professionals and residents seeking convenience will appreciate the integrated this amenity and easy road access for their commutes. This project stands out for its functional mixed-use design, blending residential comfort with essential urban amenities.</p></div></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false" id="master-plan-details-readmore-1">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

              
            
          </div>
          
       
        
