 <section class="white-box bx-no-space location-intelligence" id="location-intelligence" aria-labelledby="location-intelligence-heading">
        <span class="section-label">Location</span>
        <h2 id="location-intelligence-heading" class="section-title"> Location and Connectivity Around Veena Developers Borivali West </h2>
        
        
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><h3>Veena Celestia, Borivali West: Perfectly Connected and Strategically Positione</h3><p><strong>Veena Celestia</strong> is strategically located on <strong>Chandavarkar Lane, Borivali West</strong>, near the well-known Raj Mahal Hotel and within the established Krishna Nagar neighbourhood</p><h3>Convenience &amp; Connectivity</h3><ul><li><strong>Borivali West Railway Station – approximately 5 minutes:</strong> Provides access to Mumbai's Western suburban railway network and convenient connectivity towards major employment and commercial districts.</li><li><strong>Shimpoli Metro Station – approximately 6 minutes:</strong> Provides access to <strong>Mumbai Metro Line 2A</strong>, the Yellow Line running along Link Road and connecting Dahisar East with Andheri West.</li><li><strong>S.V. Road – approximately 2 minutes:</strong> One of the important north-south arterial roads through Mumbai's western suburbs, providing convenient road access to surrounding neighbourhoods.</li><li><strong>Link Road:</strong> Provides another important north-south road connection through the western suburbs and is also the alignment of Metro Line 2A.</li><li><strong>Western Express Highway:</strong> Provides connectivity towards Goregaon, Andheri, Bandra, the airport and other major parts of Mumbai.</li></ul><h3>Social &amp; Lifestyle Infrastructure</h3><p>Borivali West is supported by a strong mix of shopping, entertainment, dining and recreational infrastructure.</p><ul><li><strong>Link Road:</strong> A major lifestyle and retail corridor connecting several western-suburb neighbourhoods.</li><li><strong>Infiniti Mall:</strong> A prominent shopping and entertainment destination in the western suburbs.</li><li><strong>Oasis Mall:</strong> Provides additional retail and lifestyle options.</li><li><strong>Raghuleela Mall:</strong> A major shopping destination serving the Borivali–Kandivali catchment.</li><li><strong>INOX and PVR Cinemas:</strong> Provide convenient entertainment options, as highlighted on the project.</li></ul><h3>Healthcare</h3><p>Residents of Veena Celestia have access to established healthcare infrastructure across Borivali and the western suburbs.</p><ul><li>
Apex Hospitals Borivali</span></span></span></span></span> – Located on Chandavarkar Road and particularly convenient for residents in the project’s immediate neighbourhood.</li><li>
Lotus Superspeciality Hospital</span></span></span></span></span> – A multispeciality healthcare facility in Borivali West.</li><li>
Lotus Multispeciality Hospital Borivali W</span></span></span></span></span> – Another established healthcare option serving the wider Borivali West catchment.</li></ul><p>Overall, Veena Celestia's location offers a blend of established residential convenience and evolving infrastructure connectivity, making Borivali West a compelling address for both end-users and long-term property investors.</p><ul></ul></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

        
