dential, corporate, and industrial spaces.Dedicated to delivering nothing but excellence, Veena Developers prioritizes quality construction and effortless customer convenience. By incorporating luxurious amenities, each project is catered to redefine the concept of opulent living, ensuring that occupants enjoy a truly lavish lifestyle.Integrity, honesty, and trust form the strong pillars upon which Veena Developers has built its reputation. Their unwavering dedication to establishing long-term connections with clients resonates through their customer-centric approach. They aim to facilitate a comfortable and secure experience while making the dream of owning a home a reality for their valued customers.With over 33 years of exceptional leadership in the real estate industry, Veena Developers sees its remarkable journey as just the beginning. They remain committed to continually offering hassle-free customer experiences and aspire to transform the sector for decades to come. As listed on Square Yards, Veena Developers has 55 total projects, of which 50 are delivered."},{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/veena-celestia-borivali-west-mumbai-npd-345222#primaryimage","url":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/veena-celestia-project-project-large-image1-4098-opt-86929a8e-13fa-44a5-b416-621a36eb49f2.jpg","contentUrl":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/veena-celestia-project-project-large-image1-4098-opt-86929a8e-13fa-44a5-b416-621a36eb49f2.jpg","caption":"Cover image of Veena Celestia, Borivali West, Mumbai"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/veena-celestia-borivali-west-mumbai-npd-345222#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.squareyards.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"New Projects in Mumbai","item":"https://www.squareyards.com/new-projects-in-mumbai"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Projects in Borivali West","item":"https://www.squareyards.com/projects-in-borivali-west-mumbai"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"Veena Celestia","item":"https://www.squareyards.com/veena-celestia-borivali-west-mumbai-npd-345222"}]},{"@type":"RealEstateListing","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/veena-celestia-borivali-west-mumbai-npd-345222#webpage","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/veena-celestia-borivali-west-mumbai-npd-345222","name":"Veena Celestia, Borivali West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹2.70 Cr Onwards | 2, 3 BHK Flats Available","description":"Veena Celestia Borivali West, Mumbai - New Launch, 2 & 3 BHK [277-1122 sqft], ₹2.70 Cr-₹5.25 Cr. Veena Celestia Mumbai offers 159 Units on 1.87 Acres. Explore Veena Celestia Floor Plans, Amenities, RERA Details & Location. Our USPs include: ✓ Detailed Floor Plans & Master Plan, ✓ Transparent Prices and Market Trends, ✓ Complete RERA Details, ✓ Trusted Developer Track Record, ✓ Compare Similar Projects, ✓ Prime Location & Connectivity Info. Hurry up! Book your site visit on Square Yards.","inLanguage":"en-IN","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#website"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization"},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/veena-celestia-borivali-west-mumbai-npd-345222#breadcrumb"},"mainEntity":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/veena-celestia-borivali-west-mumbai-npd-345222#project"},"relatedLink":"https://www.squareyards.com/cma/compare-veena-celestia-with-similar-nearby-projects","primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/veena-celestia-borivali-west-mumbai-npd-345222#primaryimage"},"mentions":[{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/veena-developers-projects/8972/builder#organization"},{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/borivali-west-in-mumbai-overview-941#place"},{"@type":"ApartmentComplex","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/veena-celestia-borivali-west-mumbai-npd-345222#project","name":"Veena Celestia","url":"https://www.squar